 us instructions\; the guide does not identify those grades as having a hal
 f day.\nPre-K and kindergarten: half day\nSource: https://www.ccisd.net/fs
 /resource-manager/view/0ed47cf4-1201-4cb4-9b4b-fd96c8fb47ee\nSchedule sour
 ce: https://www.ccisd.net/backtoschool
